            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#4f6275' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>Results from fis-ski.com (individual World Cup events only, no team events, qualifying or trial rounds) – 668 men&apos;s and 261 women&apos;s events, collected October 2026. One men&apos;s race is missing from FIS&apos;s own listing. A season is named by the year it ends, so 2025 means 2024/25. Jump distances only go back to 2015. Ages are worked out from birth year alone, so might be a year out. Home hill only includes nations with 150+ starts at home.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
